# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We aim to create an inclusive, safe, and welcoming community for everyone contributing to our interactive math games, regardless of background. Note that while current games are in Norwegian, we welcome contributions, ideas, and translations from the global community.

## Our Standards
We foster a positive environment through respect, empathy, and constructive feedback, while unacceptable behavior (harassment, personal attacks, publishing private info) will not be tolerated.

## Enforcement
Project maintainers will enforce these standards and take necessary action against inappropriate behavior.

## Scope
This code applies within all project spaces, including [https://bjarneelb.github.io/ligningsvekt/](https://bjarneelb.github.io/ligningsvekt/) and associated GitHub repositories.

## Reporting
For reporting issues or inappropriate behavior, please contact:
